&gt; Build an aimed probe that isolates exactly one open question: whether the Number
&gt; coercion this project attaches to variable operands is correct at a direct Set
&gt; Brightness parameter, as opposed to the If-condition operand position a donor
&gt; already confirms. Four legs: a coerced Set Brightness, an identical uncoerced
&gt; control, a Get Device Details brightness read, and a restore leg so running it
&gt; cannot strand the display.</string>
			</dict>
